---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import EntityArticle from '../../components/v2/templates/EntityArticle.astro';
import { entityImages } from '../../data/images';
import { getPageSEO } from '../../utils/seo';
const pageSEO = getPageSEO('equipment-standard-stove');
---

<BaseLayout pageId="equipment-standard-stove" breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Equipment', href: '/equipment/' }, { label: 'Stoves', href: '/equipment/stoves/' }, { label: pageSEO.h1 }]}>
<EntityArticle
  title={pageSEO.h1}
  kicker="Equipment profile"
  intro="The Standard Stove is a named cooking-equipment entry in the Karinderya Stove directory."
  heroImage={entityImages.standardStove}
  tableOfContents
  previousPage={{ label: 'Basic Stove', href: '/equipment/basic-stove/' }}
  nextPage={{ label: 'Deluxe Stove', href: '/equipment/deluxe-stove/' }}
  relatedLinks={[
    { label: 'Equipment Hub', href: '/equipment/', description: 'Browse restaurant equipment categories and usage guidance.' },
    { label: 'Stoves Directory', href: '/equipment/stoves/', description: 'Browse every Stove entry currently covered by the Wiki.' },
    { label: 'Cooking and Serving Guide', href: '/guides/cooking-and-serving/', description: 'Follow cooking as part of the complete restaurant service workflow.' },
    { label: 'Beginner Guide', href: '/guides/beginner-guide/', description: 'Learn the main restaurant systems and how they connect.' },
  ]}
>
  <h2 id="short-answer">Short Answer</h2>
  <p>Standard Stove is a named stove shown in dated Karinderya placement footage. It appears in the same Stoves inventory as the Basic and Deluxe entries.</p>

  <h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
  <p>The capture confirms the displayed name and category, but it does not provide a reliable permanent price, cooking-time difference, capacity, or unlock rule.</p>

  <h2 id="how-it-works">How It Works</h2>
  <p>Select the Standard Stove from owned inventory when it is present, then place it through the current customization interface. Use current in-game prompts for cooking behavior.</p>

  <h2 id="usage">How Players Obtain It</h2>
  <p>The current acquisition route has not been confirmed from a creator-owned source. Check the live inventory and shop instead of treating Standard as a required step in a fixed upgrade sequence.</p>

  <h2 id="gameplay-tips">Gameplay Tips</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Keep cooking equipment within a clearly organized kitchen work area.</li>
    <li>Consider the complete preparation and serving workflow when organizing restaurant tasks.</li>
    <li>Use the related navigation to compare Wiki coverage without assuming unlisted item properties.</li>
  </ul>
</EntityArticle>
</BaseLayout>
